msgid "Auto = each student's limit = their Program's max absence % × scheduled meetings (auto-disabled for Virtual). Custom = the fixed number below applies to everyone. Disabled = no attendance limit for this course. Editable only by the registrar / Program Chair."
msgstr ""
"Automático = el límite de cada estudiante = el porcentaje máximo de "
