#. Description of the 'Person' (Link) field in DocType 'Student Applicant'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/student_applicant/student_applicant.json
msgid "Identity spine record. Promoted from this form on insert; intake fields stay editable (and re-promote) until admission, then flip to read-only mirrors."
msgstr ""
"Registro del eje de identidad. Se promueve desde este formulario al "
"insertarlo; los campos de admisión permanecen editables (y se vuelven a "
"promover) hasta la admisión; después se convierten en espejos de solo "
"lectura."

#. Description of the 'Email + In-App fallback' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Seminary Announcement'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/seminary_announcement/seminary_announcement.json
msgid "If a recipient can't be reached on any selected channel (no address, or opted out), send them Email + In-App instead so the announcement still arrives. Email is always available."
msgstr ""
"Si no se puede contactar con un destinatario a través de ninguno de los "
"canales seleccionados (no tiene dirección o ha rechazado recibir mensajes), "
"envíele el mensaje por correo electrónico y dentro de la aplicación para "
"garantizar que el anuncio llegue. El correo electrónico siempre está "
"disponible."

#. Description of the 'Per Student' (Check) field in DocType 'Event Custom
#. Category'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/event_custom_category/event_custom_category.json
msgid "If checked, each student attends individually (e.g. a thesis defense, exit interview) and one Event is created per student. If unchecked, a single Event occurrence satisfies the whole cohort enrolled at the time (e.g. a convocation)."
msgstr ""
"Si se marca, cada estudiante asiste individualmente (por ejemplo, a la "
"defensa de una tesis o a una entrevista de egreso) y se crea un Evento por "
"estudiante. Si no se marca, una sola instancia del Evento es suficiente para "
"toda la cohorte inscrita en ese momento (por ejemplo, una ceremonia de "
"graduación)."

#. Description of the 'Allow Instructors to Override' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Competency Framework'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/competency_framework/competency_framework.json
msgid "If checked, instructors will be able to define how they want the content released for each course schedule."
msgstr ""
"Si se marca, los instructores podrán definir cómo desean que se publique el "
"contenido para cada horario de curso."

#. Description of the 'Evidence Required by Staff' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Graduation Requirement Item'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/graduation_requirement_item/graduation_requirement_item.json
msgid "If checked, staff must attach verifying evidence when marking this requirement Fulfilled."
msgstr "Si está marcado, el personal debe adjuntar pruebas de verificación al marcar este requisito cumplimentado."

#. Description of the 'Evidence Required by Staff' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Placement Assessment'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/placement_assessment/placement_assessment.json
msgid "If checked, the Placement Examiner must attach verifying evidence when recording the score."
msgstr ""
"Si se marca, el evaluador de la práctica debe adjuntar pruebas de "
"verificación al registrar la puntuación."

#. Description of the 'Evidence Submitted by Student' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Placement Assessment'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/placement_assessment/placement_assessment.json
msgid "If checked, the student is given a button on the portal to attach evidence themselves (e.g. an official score report)."
msgstr ""
"Si se marca, se muestra al estudiante un botón en el portal para adjuntar "
"pruebas por sí mismo (por ejemplo, un informe oficial de calificaciones)."

#. Description of the 'Evidence Submitted by Student' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Graduation Requirement Item'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/graduation_requirement_item/graduation_requirement_item.json
msgid "If checked, the student is given a button on the portal to attach evidence themselves (e.g. signed acknowledgment, certificate)."
msgstr "Si está marcado, se le dará al estudiante un botón en el portal para adjuntar pruebas ellos mismos (por ejemplo, reconocimiento firmado, certificado)."

#. Description of the 'Advisory Only' (Check) field in DocType 'Program Track'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/program_track/program_track.json
msgid "If checked, this emphasis is informational only and does not affect graduation requirements."
msgstr "Si está marcado, este énfasis es informativo sólo y no afecta a los requisitos de graduación."

#. Description of the 'Make Academic Term Mandatory' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Seminary Settings'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/seminary_settings/seminary_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, field Academic Term will be Mandatory in Program Enrollment Tool."
msgstr "Si está habilitado, el campo Término Académico será Mandatorio en la Herramienta de Inscripción del Programa."

#. Description of the 'Auto-advance Course Schedule states' (Check) field in
#. DocType 'Seminary Settings'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/seminary_settings/seminary_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, the daily scheduler advances Course Schedule states by their enrollment dates (Draft → Open for Enrollment, Open for Enrollment → Enrollment Closed) and sends late-grade reminders. Disable for seminaries that prefer fully manual control of the lifecycle."
msgstr "Si está activado, el planificador diario avanza la programación del curso según sus fechas de inscripción (borrador → Abrir para la inscripción, Abierto para matriculación → Cerrado de inscripción) y envía recordatorios de grado tardío. Deshabilitar para seminarios que prefieren un control manual completo del ciclo de vida."

#. Description of the 'Enable Automated Billing' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Seminary Settings'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/seminary_settings/seminary_settings.json
msgid "If enabled, the daily scheduler generates invoices on Academic Term start, Academic Year start, and the 1st of each month. Disable during initial setup or data migration."
msgstr "Si está habilitado, el planificador diario genera facturas en el inicio del término académico, inicio del año académico, y el 1 de cada mes. Desactivar durante la configuración inicial o la migración de datos."

#. Description of the 'Should audit be charged per credit hour?' (Check) field
#. in DocType 'Seminary Settings'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/seminary_settings/seminary_settings.json
msgid "If not checked, the corresponding fee will be the same for all audited courses."
msgstr "Si no está marcado, la tarifa correspondiente será la misma para todos los cursos auditados."

#. Description of the 'Only these Programs' (Table) field in DocType 'Seminary
#. Announcement'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/seminary_announcement/seminary_announcement.json
msgid "If set, narrows the student audience to these programs. Leave empty for all programs."
msgstr "Si se establece, reduce la audiencia de los estudiantes a estos programas. Dejar en blanco para todos los programas."

#. Description of the 'Only these Course Schedules' (Table) field in DocType
#. 'Seminary Announcement'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/seminary_announcement/seminary_announcement.json
msgid "If set, narrows to these course schedules: their students (and, if the instructor checkbox is on, their instructors)."
msgstr "Si se establece, se reduce a los horarios de estos cursos: sus estudiantes (y, si la casilla de verificación del instructor está activada, sus instructores)."

#. Description of the 'Fallback Emphasis' (Link) field in DocType 'Program'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/program/program.json
msgid "If set, students who do not declare or meet a specific emphasis will fall back to this track (e.g. General Studies)."
msgstr "Si se establece, los estudiantes que no declaren o no cumplan un énfasis específico caerán en este tema (por ejemplo, Estudios Generales)."

#. Description of the 'Closes On' (Date) field in DocType 'Partner Job Opening'
#: seminary/partner/doctype/partner_job_opening/partner_job_opening.json
msgid "If set, the job opening will be closed automatically after this date"
msgstr ""
"Si se establece, la oferta de empleo se cerrará automáticamente después de "
"esta fecha"

#. Description of the 'Allow Discussions' (Check) field in DocType 'Course
#. Lesson'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/course_lesson/course_lesson.json
msgid "If the lesson has quiz or exam, discussions will be automatically disabled."
msgstr "Si la lección tiene un cuestionario o un examen, las discusiones se desactivarán automáticamente."

#: frontend/src/pages/StudentGroup.vue:15
#: seminary/public/frontend/assets/StudentGroup-BpjtyPuL.js:1
msgid "If the page does not refresh automatically after saving changes, please try reloading the page."
msgstr "Si la página no se actualiza automáticamente después de guardar los cambios, intenta recargarla."

#. Description of the 'Use Student Groups' (Check) field in DocType 'Discussion
#. Activity'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/discussion_activity/discussion_activity.json
msgid "If unchecked, all students will participate in the same thread."
msgstr "Si no está marcado, todos los estudiantes participarán en el mismo hilo."

#. Description of the 'Student chooses' (Check) field in DocType 'Graduation
#. Requirement Item'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/graduation_requirement_item/graduation_requirement_item.json
msgid "If unchecked, the registrar will need to assign the option. Otherwise, the student will be able to choose from the Portal."
msgstr ""
"Si no está seleccionada, el registrador deberá asignar la opción. De lo "
"contrario, el estudiante podrá elegirla desde el Portal."

#. Description of the 'Show in Directory' (Check) field in DocType 'Alumni
#. Profile'
#: seminary/alumni/doctype/alumni_profile/alumni_profile.json
msgid "If unchecked, this profile is hidden from the public alumni directory."
msgstr "Si no está marcado, este perfil está oculto en el directorio público de antiguos alumnos."

