msgstr "Número mínimo de asesores opcionales de estudiantes matriculados para un Curso de Programación de este curso. Sólo informativo — usado por el informe de estado de inscripción de términos. Los horarios del curso pueden anular esto."

#. Description of the 'Submission Form Template' (Attach) field in DocType
#. 'Internship Requirement Template'
#: seminary/partner/doctype/internship_requirement_template/internship_requirement_template.json
msgid "Optional blank form for a party to download, fill, and re-upload as their submission (e.g. a site evaluation form)."
msgstr ""
"Formulario en blanco opcional para que una parte lo descargue, complete y "
"vuelva a cargar como su entrega (por ejemplo, un formulario de evaluación "
"del sitio)."

#. Description of the 'Pay Rates' (Section Break) field in DocType 'Instructor
#. Category'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/instructor_category/instructor_category.json
msgid "Optional configuration."
msgstr "Configuración opcional."

#. Description of the 'Supporting Document' (Attach) field in DocType 'Partner
#. Seminary'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/partner_seminary/partner_seminary.json
msgid "Optional decision artifact (partnership agreement, accreditor letter, director approval) documenting the relationship."
msgstr "Artefacto opcional de decisión (acuerdo de asociación, carta de acreditor, aprobación del director) que documenta la relación."

#. Description of the 'Response Sources Path' (Data) field in DocType
#. 'Plagiarism Provider Account'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/plagiarism_provider_account/plagiarism_provider_account.json
msgid "Optional dotted path to a list of matched sources in the response JSON."
msgstr ""
"Ruta opcional con puntos a una lista de fuentes coincidentes en el JSON de "
"respuesta."

#. Description of the 'Extra Settings (JSON)' (Code) field in DocType 'Channel
#. Provider Account'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/channel_provider_account/channel_provider_account.json
msgid "Optional extra provider configuration as raw JSON, merged underneath the fields above (the typed fields win). Secrets belong in the encrypted fields above, not here."
msgstr ""
"Configuración adicional opcional del proveedor como JSON sin procesar, "
"combinada por debajo de los campos anteriores (los campos tipados prevalecen)"
". Los secretos deben estar en los campos cifrados anteriores, no aquí."

#. Description of the 'Extra Settings (JSON)' (Code) field in DocType
#. 'Plagiarism Provider Account'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/plagiarism_provider_account/plagiarism_provider_account.json
msgid "Optional extra provider configuration as raw JSON, merged underneath the typed fields (the fields win). Secrets belong in the encrypted API Key field, not here."
msgstr ""
"Configuración adicional opcional del proveedor como JSON sin procesar, "
"combinada por debajo de los campos tipados (los campos tienen prioridad). "
"Los secretos deben incluirse en el campo de clave de API cifrada, no aquí."

#. Description of the 'Feedback File' (Attach) field in DocType 'Assignment
#. Submission'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/assignment_submission/assignment_submission.json
msgid "Optional file attached by the evaluator (e.g. a marked-up .docx) alongside the rich-text comments."
msgstr ""
"Archivo opcional adjuntado por el evaluador (por ejemplo, un archivo .docx "
"con marcas) junto con los comentarios con formato enriquecido."

#. Description of the 'Category' (Data) field in DocType 'Skill Tag'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/skill_tag/skill_tag.json
msgid "Optional grouping, e.g. \"Ministry\", \"Language\", \"Administration\"."
msgstr "Agrupación opcional, p. ej., «Ministerio», «Idioma», «Administración»."

#. Description of the 'Introduction' (Text Editor) field in DocType 'Term
#. Admission'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/term_admission/term_admission.json
msgid "Optional intro text shown on Program pages above the open-windows block."
msgstr "Texto de introducción opcional que se muestra en las páginas del programa sobre el bloque de ventanas abiertas."

#. Description of the 'Customer' (Link) field in DocType 'Partner Seminary'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/partner_seminary/partner_seminary.json
msgid "Optional link to a Customer record for registering contacts and other partner-institution information."
msgstr "Enlace opcional a un registro de clientes para registrar contactos y otra información de la institución asociada."

#. Description of the 'Current Partner Organization' (Link) field in DocType
#. 'Alumni Profile'
#: seminary/alumni/doctype/alumni_profile/alumni_profile.json
msgid "Optional link to a Partner Organization the seminary already knows, when the free text above names one. Shown as a clickable badge in the directory while the partner directory is enabled; the free text is never replaced by it (ADR 053 phase 4, ADR 070)."
msgstr ""
"Enlace opcional a una organización asociada que el seminario ya conoce, "
"cuando el texto libre anterior menciona una. Se muestra como una insignia en "
"la que se puede hacer clic en el directorio mientras el directorio de "
"organizaciones asociadas está habilitado; el texto libre nunca se reemplaza "
"por ella (ADR 053, fase 4; ADR 070)."

#. Description of the 'Credit Override' (Float) field in DocType 'Partner
#. Seminary Course Equivalence'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/partner_seminary_course_equivalence/partner_seminary_course_equivalence.json
msgid "Optional override for the resolved internal credit. If blank, uses Partner Seminary.credit_unit_ratio × source_credit_value."
msgstr "Anulación opcional para el crédito interno resuelto. Si está en blanco, utiliza Partner Seminary.credit_unit_ratio × source_credit_value."

#. Description of the 'Parent Unit' (Link) field in DocType 'Academic Unit'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/academic_unit/academic_unit.json
msgid "Optional parent in the organizational hierarchy (e.g. a department under a school). Used for oversight roll-up; independent of an Interdepartment's Member Units (academic co-ownership). Cannot form a cycle."
msgstr ""
"Elemento principal opcional en la jerarquía organizativa (por ejemplo, un "
"departamento dentro de una escuela). Se utiliza para consolidar la "
"supervisión; es independiente de las Unidades miembro de Interdepartment "
"(copropiedad académica). No puede formar un ciclo."

#. Description of the 'Conversion Policy Override' (Link) field in DocType
#. 'Partner Seminary Course Equivalence'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/partner_seminary_course_equivalence/partner_seminary_course_equivalence.json
msgid "Optional per-course conversion policy override. Rare; used when a specific course uses a different scale than the partner's default (e.g., a music department using pass/fail)."
msgstr "Anulación de la política de conversión por curso opcional. Rare; usado cuando un curso específico usa una escala diferente a la predeterminada del socio (por ejemplo, un departamento de música usando pass/fail)."

#. Description of the 'Deep-link Prefix' (Data) field in DocType 'Communication
#. Channel'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/communication_channel/communication_channel.json
msgid "Optional public deep-link prefix, e.g. https://wa.me/ or https://t.me/ — appended with the contact's address to open the external app directly. Leave blank for channels with no public deep link (the icon then routes through the logged comms inbox)."
msgstr ""
"Prefijo opcional de enlace directo público, p. ej., https://wa.me/ o https://"
"t.me/ — se añade a la dirección del contacto para abrir directamente la "
"aplicación externa. Déjalo en blanco para los canales sin enlace directo "
"público (el icono dirige entonces a través de la bandeja de entrada de "
"comunicaciones registradas)."

#. Description of the 'Voice Recording' (Attach) field in DocType 'Seminary
#. Announcement'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/seminary_announcement/seminary_announcement.json
msgid "Optional recording for the Voice channel — the call plays this instead of reading the text aloud. MP3 or WAV, up to 40 MB (≈40 min); keep it short. Made public so the carrier can fetch it."
msgstr ""
"Grabación opcional para el canal de voz: la llamada la reproduce en lugar de "
"leer el texto en voz alta. MP3 o WAV, de hasta 40 MB (≈40 min); manténgala "
"breve. Se hace pública para que el operador pueda obtenerla."

#. Description of the 'Weight' (Float) field in DocType 'Course Competency
#. Dimension'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/course_competency_dimension/course_competency_dimension.json
msgid "Optional relative weight of this dimension within the competency."
msgstr "Peso relativo opcional de esta dimensión dentro de la competencia."

#. Description of the 'Auth Scheme' (Data) field in DocType 'Plagiarism
#. Provider Account'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/plagiarism_provider_account/plagiarism_provider_account.json
msgid "Optional scheme prefix on the auth header value (e.g. Bearer)."
msgstr ""
"Prefijo opcional del esquema en el valor del encabezado de autenticación (p. "
"ej., Bearer)."

#. Description of the 'Reference Document Type' (Link) field in DocType 'Cohort
#. Post'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/cohort_post/cohort_post.json
msgid "Optional source record, e.g. the video assignment behind a Sermon Lab post."
msgstr ""
"Registro de origen opcional, por ejemplo, la asignación de video en la que "
"se basa una publicación de Sermon Lab."

#. Description of the 'Congregation Size' (Select) field in DocType 'Partner
#. Organization Location'
#: seminary/partner/doctype/partner_organization_location/partner_organization_location.json
msgid "Optional — applies to churches; leave blank for non-congregational organizations."
msgstr ""
"Opcional — se aplica a iglesias; déjelo en blanco para organizaciones no "
"congregacionales."

#. Description of the 'Doctrinal Statement' (Text Editor) field in DocType
#. 'Partner Organization'
#: seminary/partner/doctype/partner_organization/partner_organization.json
msgid "Optional. A statement of faith / doctrinal position, so applicants can assess theological fit."
msgstr ""
"Opcional. Una declaración de fe o postura doctrinal, para que los "
"solicitantes puedan evaluar la afinidad teológica."

#. Description of the 'Building' (Link) field in DocType 'Room'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/room/room.json
msgid "Optional. Building this room belongs to (Campus → Building → Room)."
msgstr ""
"Opcional. Edificio al que pertenece esta sala (Campus → Edificio → Sala)."

#. Description of the 'Original Student Record' (Link) field in DocType 'Alumni
#. Profile'
#: seminary/alumni/doctype/alumni_profile/alumni_profile.json
msgid "Optional. Empty for non-student alumni (e.g. honorary, transfer, board)."
msgstr "Opcional. Vacío para ex alumnos no estudiantiles (por ejemplo, honor, transferencia, tabla)."

#: frontend/src/pages/ProgramAudit.vue:399
msgid "Optional. Example: JOH-ann mar-TEEN-ess"
msgstr "Opcional. Ejemplo: JOH-ann mar-TEEN-ess"

#. Description of the 'Customer' (Link) field in DocType 'Partner Organization'
#: seminary/partner/doctype/partner_organization/partner_organization.json
msgid "Optional. Link a Customer only when this partner is also billed (sponsorship, placement fee). Leave blank for a pure relationship — we never auto-create a Customer."
msgstr ""
"Opcional. Vincule un Cliente solo cuando también se facture a este socio "
"(patrocinio, tarifa de colocación). Déjelo en blanco para una relación pura: "
"nunca creamos automáticamente un Cliente."

#. Description of the 'Partner Organization' (Link) field in DocType 'Partner
#. Seminary'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/partner_seminary/partner_seminary.json
msgid "Optional. Link the relationship-side record when this same external institution is also a ministry/employment partner (job board, internships, alumni placement). Not applicable to internal legacy records."
msgstr ""
"Opcional. Vincule el registro del lado de relaciones cuando esta misma "
"institución externa también sea una organización asociada de ministerio o "
"empleo (bolsa de trabajo, prácticas, colocación de exalumnos). No se aplica "
"a los registros heredados internos."

#. Description of the 'Documentation Link (optional)' (Data) field in DocType
#. 'Seminary Help Entry'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/seminary_help_entry/seminary_help_entry.json
msgid "Optional. On Desk forms the documentation link comes from the doctype's own \"Documentation Link\" property; this field is mainly for frontend (Vue) pages that have no doctype."
msgstr ""
"Opcional. En los formularios de Desk, el enlace de documentación proviene de "
"la propiedad \"Enlace de documentación\" del propio tipo de documento; este "
"campo está destinado principalmente a las páginas del frontend (Vue) que no "
"tienen un tipo de documento."

#. Description of the 'Programs Menu Label Override' (Data) field in DocType
#. 'Website Branding'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/website_branding/website_branding.json
msgid "Optional. Overrides the auto singular/plural label for the programs catalogue (\"Our Program\" vs \"Our Programs\"). Leave blank to let the site pick based on how many programs are published."
msgstr ""
"Opcional. Reemplaza la etiqueta automática en singular/plural del catálogo "
"de programas («Nuestro programa» frente a «Nuestros programas»). Déjelo en "
"blanco para que el sitio elija según la cantidad de programas publicados."

#. Description of the 'Group Label' (Data) field in DocType 'Portal Messaging
#. Rule'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/portal_messaging_rule/portal_messaging_rule.json
msgid "Optional. Overrides the heading recipients are grouped under in the compose picker."
msgstr ""
"Opcional. Anula el encabezado bajo el que se agrupan los destinatarios en el "
"selector de redacción."

#. Description of the 'Program' (Link) field in DocType 'Leveling Profile'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/leveling_profile/leveling_profile.json
msgid "Optional. Restrict this profile to one program; leave blank to make it available for any program."
msgstr ""
"Opcional. Restrinja este perfil a un programa; déjelo en blanco para que "
"esté disponible para cualquier programa."

#. Description of the 'Bot Username' (Data) field in DocType 'Channel Provider
#. Account'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/channel_provider_account/channel_provider_account.json
msgid "Optional. The bot's @username (auto-detected from the token if blank)."
msgstr ""
"Opcional. El @username del bot (se detecta automáticamente a partir del "
"token si se deja en blanco)."

#. Description of the 'Public URL (override)' (Data) field in DocType 'Channel
#. Provider Account'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/channel_provider_account/channel_provider_account.json
msgid "Optional. The public HTTPS base/URL the provider was configured to call, if the site sits behind a proxy that rewrites the request URL (used for webhook signature verification)."
msgstr ""
"Opcional. La base o URL HTTPS pública a la que se configuró que llamara el "
"proveedor, si el sitio se encuentra detrás de un proxy que reescribe la URL "
"de la solicitud (se utiliza para verificar la firma del webhook)."

#. Description of the 'Messaging Service SID' (Data) field in DocType 'Channel
#. Provider Account'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/channel_provider_account/channel_provider_account.json
msgid "Optional. Use a Twilio Messaging Service (MG...) instead of a fixed From number."
msgstr ""
"Opcional. Use un servicio de mensajería de Twilio (MG...) en lugar de un "
"número fijo en el campo De."

#. Description of the 'Backing Course' (Link) field in DocType 'Internship
#. Type'
#: seminary/partner/doctype/internship_type/internship_type.json
msgid "Optional. When set, this internship carries the course's credits, grade and fees: an application enrolls the student in the course and evaluation follows the course. Leave blank for a non-credit internship."
msgstr ""
"Opcional. Cuando se establece, esta pasantía incluye los créditos, la "
"calificación y las tasas del curso: una solicitud inscribe al estudiante en "
"el curso y la evaluación sigue el curso. Déjelo en blanco para una pasantía "
"sin créditos."

#. Description of the 'Bible ID Override' (Data) field in DocType 'Question'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/question/question.json
msgid "Optional. api.bible Bible ID (e.g. bba9f40183526463-01 for BSB). Leave blank to use the language default from Bible API Settings at fetch time."
msgstr ""
"Opcional. ID de la Biblia de api.bible (p. ej., bba9f40183526463-01 para BSB)"
". Déjelo en blanco para utilizar el idioma predeterminado de la "
"configuración de la API de la Biblia al momento de obtener los datos."

#. Description of the 'Category' (Select) field in DocType 'Person Channel
#. Address'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/person_channel_address/person_channel_address.json
msgid "Optional: restrict this address to one message category (e.g. a separate promotional email). Blank = any category."
msgstr ""
"Opcional: restrinja esta dirección a una categoría de mensajes (p. ej., un "
"correo electrónico promocional independiente). En blanco = cualquier "
"categoría."

#. Description of the 'Context DocType' (Link) field in DocType 'Communication
#. Template'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/communication_template/communication_template.json
msgid "Optional: the doctype this template expects as its rendering context ('doc' in Jinja)."
msgstr ""
"Opcional: el tipo de documento que esta plantilla espera como contexto de "
"renderizado («doc» en Jinja)."

#. Label of the section_break_uqmw (Section Break) field in DocType 'Graduation
#. Requirement Item'
#. Name of a DocType
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/graduation_requirement_item/graduation_requirement_item.json
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/options/options.json
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Opciones"

#: frontend/src/pages/RecommenderForm.vue:40
#: seminary/public/frontend/assets/RecommenderForm--SK62QRO.js:1
msgid "Or attach a signed letter (optional)"
msgstr "O adjunta una letra firmada (opcional)"

#: frontend/src/pages/Community.vue:547
msgid "Or invite someone who is not in the directory:"
msgstr "O invite a alguien que no esté en el directorio:"

#. Label of the order_pd (Data) field in DocType 'Program'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/program/program.json
msgid "Order in Programs and Degrees"
msgstr "Orden en Programas y Grados"

#. Description of the 'Sequence' (Int) field in DocType 'Culminating Project
#. Type Milestone'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/culminating_project_type_milestone/culminating_project_type_milestone.json
msgid "Order in which milestones are presented and chained (used by the 'Previous Milestone' anchor)."
msgstr ""
"Orden en el que se presentan y encadenan los hitos (utilizado por el anclaje "
"«Hito anterior»)."

#. Description of the 'Sequence' (Int) field in DocType 'Internship Requirement
#. Template'
#: seminary/partner/doctype/internship_requirement_template/internship_requirement_template.json
msgid "Order in which requirements are presented and chained (used by the 'Previous Requirement' anchor)."
msgstr ""
"Orden en el que se presentan y encadenan los requisitos (utilizado por el "
"anclaje «Requisito anterior»)."

#. Description of the 'Sequence' (Int) field in DocType 'Course Competency'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/course_competency/course_competency.json
msgid "Order in which this competency is developed within the course."
msgstr "Orden en que se desarrolla esta competencia dentro del curso."

#. Description of the 'Web Order' (Int) field in DocType 'Program Level'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/program_level/program_level.json
msgid "Order of this level's section on the public Programs page (lowest first; ties fall back to the level name)."
msgstr ""
"Orden de la sección de este nivel en la página pública de Programas (primero "
"los valores más bajos; en caso de empate, se utiliza el nombre del nivel)."

#. Description of the 'Web Order' (Int) field in DocType 'Academic Unit
#. Membership'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/academic_unit_membership/academic_unit_membership.json
msgid "Order of this person on the public website roster for this unit (lowest first, e.g. 1 = President, 2 = Vice-President). 0 = unordered: falls back to chair-first, then alphabetical."
msgstr ""
"Orden de esta persona en la lista pública del sitio web para esta unidad (de "
"menor a mayor; por ejemplo, 1 = Presidente, 2 = Vicepresidente). 0 = sin "
"orden: se muestra primero por presidente y luego alfabéticamente."

#. Description of the 'Milestones' (Table) field in DocType 'Culminating
#. Project Type'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/culminating_project_type/culminating_project_type.json
msgid "Ordered milestone template for this project type. Snapshotted onto each project when it is activated; due dates are computed from each milestone's anchor + offset. A Defense is just a milestone with kind 'Defense' and its required sign-offs."
msgstr ""
"Plantilla ordenada de hitos para este tipo de proyecto. Se guarda como "
"instantánea en cada proyecto cuando se activa; las fechas de vencimiento se "
"calculan a partir del ancla y el desplazamiento de cada hito. Una defensa es "
"simplemente un hito con el tipo «Defensa» y sus aprobaciones requeridas."

