"Configúrelo por seminario y asegúrese de que el curso pertenezca a "
"programas; déjelo en blanco hasta que exista el curso."

#: seminary/install.py:145
msgid "The course did not reach the minimum number of enrolled students by the enrollment deadline."
msgstr ""
"El curso no alcanzó el número mínimo de estudiantes matriculados antes de la "
"fecha límite de matriculación."

#. Description of the 'Course Enrollment' (Link) field in DocType 'Internship
#. Application'
#: seminary/partner/doctype/internship_application/internship_application.json
msgid "The course enrollment created for a course-backed internship (carries credits, grade and fees)."
msgstr ""
"La matrícula en el curso creada para unas prácticas vinculadas a un curso "
"(con créditos, calificación y tasas)."

#. Description of the 'Internal Course' (Link) field in DocType 'Partner
#. Seminary Course Equivalence'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/partner_seminary_course_equivalence/partner_seminary_course_equivalence.json
msgid "The course in this institution's catalog that the partner course maps to."
msgstr "El curso en el catálogo de esta institución al que se asigna el curso asociado."

#: seminary/install.py:163
msgid "The course is cancelled by administrative or departmental decision (resource constraints, restructuring)."
msgstr ""
"El curso se cancela por decisión administrativa o departamental "
"(limitaciones de recursos, reestructuración)."

#: seminary/install.py:169
msgid "The course is cancelled due to circumstances beyond the seminary's control (natural disaster, public health, civil unrest)."
msgstr ""
"El curso se cancela debido a circunstancias fuera del control del seminario "
"(desastre natural, emergencia de salud pública o disturbios civiles)."

#. Description of the 'Source Course Schedule' (Link) field in DocType 'Cohort'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/cohort/cohort.json
msgid "The course offering this cohort was created from. The cohort is independently managed thereafter — student-group changes don't sync back."
msgstr ""
"La oferta de curso a partir de la cual se creó esta cohorte. A partir de "
"entonces, la cohorte se gestiona de forma independiente: los cambios en los "
"grupos de estudiantes no se sincronizan."

#: seminary/install.py:157
msgid "The course was removed from or changed in the curriculum after the schedule was published."
msgstr ""
"El curso se eliminó del plan de estudios o se modificó en él después de "
"publicarse el horario."

#. Description of the Onboarding Step 'Create your Programs'
#: seminary/seminary/onboarding_step/program/program.json
msgid "The curriculum (M.Div., Certificate, etc.) — attach Fee Categories here"
msgstr "El currículo (M.Div., certificado, etc.) — adjuntar categorías de cuota aquí"

#. Description of the 'Narrative' (Text Editor) field in DocType 'Competency
#. Assessment'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/competency_assessment/competency_assessment.json
msgid "The descriptive part of the assessment. Numbers alone do not carry formation."
msgstr ""
"La parte descriptiva de la evaluación. Los números por sí solos no aportan "
"formación."

#. Description of the 'Computed' (Float) field in DocType 'Competency Result'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/competency_result/competency_result.json
msgid "The dimensions combined by the framework's rule, before any edit and before rounding."
msgstr ""
"Las dimensiones combinadas por la regla del marco de trabajo, antes de "
"cualquier edición y antes del redondeo."

#. Description of a DocType
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/diploma/diploma.json
msgid "The diploma issued to a student when their graduation request is approved. It records the legal name as printed, the program, and the official graduation date. Created automatically on approval, and marked revoked rather than deleted if the graduation is later cancelled."
msgstr ""
"El diploma que se expide a un estudiante cuando se aprueba su solicitud de "
"graduación. Registra el nombre legal tal como aparece impreso, el programa y "
"la fecha oficial de graduación. Se crea automáticamente al aprobarse y se "
"marca como revocado, en lugar de eliminarse, si posteriormente se cancela la "
"graduación."

#: frontend/src/pages/AlumniProfile.vue:134
#: seminary/public/frontend/assets/AlumniProfile-D4TdFPKe.js:1
msgid "The directory"
msgstr "El directorio"

#. Description of the 'Capabilities' (Table) field in DocType 'Academic Unit
#. Membership'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/academic_unit_membership/academic_unit_membership.json
msgid "The duties this person performs in this unit, each with an optional capacity cap."
msgstr ""
"Las funciones que desempeña esta persona en esta unidad, cada una con un "
"límite de capacidad opcional."

#. Description of the 'Supersedes' (Link) field in DocType 'Competency
#. Framework'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/competency_framework/competency_framework.json
msgid "The earlier framework this one replaces. Keeps past cohorts on the rules they started under."
msgstr ""
"El marco anterior que este reemplaza. Mantiene a las cohortes anteriores "
"bajo las reglas con las que comenzaron."

#. Description of the 'Supersedes' (Link) field in DocType 'Program Graduation
#. Requirement'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/program_graduation_requirement/program_graduation_requirement.json
msgid "The earlier policy this version replaces."
msgstr "La política anterior que reemplaza esta versión."

#. Description of the 'Glyph' (Data) field in DocType 'Cohort Reaction Type'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/cohort_reaction_type/cohort_reaction_type.json
msgid "The emoji shown for this reaction."
msgstr "El emoji que se muestra para esta reacción."

#. Description of the 'Program Enrollment' (Link) field in DocType 'Alumni
#. Graduation'
#: seminary/alumni/doctype/alumni_graduation/alumni_graduation.json
msgid "The enrollment this graduation came from. Blank for an alumnus recorded by import rather than by graduating here."
msgstr ""
"La matrícula de la que procede esta graduación. Déjelo en blanco para un "
"exalumno registrado mediante una importación en lugar de haberse graduado "
"aquí."

#. Description of the 'Program Enrollment' (Link) field in DocType 'Chapel
#. Attendance'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/chapel_attendance/chapel_attendance.json
msgid "The enrollment whose Chapel Attendance requirement this check-in counts toward (resolved at check-in)."
msgstr ""
"La matrícula cuyo requisito de Asistencia a la capilla se contabiliza con "
"este registro (resuelto al registrarse)."

#: frontend/src/pages/ExamSubmission.vue:410
#: seminary/public/frontend/assets/ExamSubmission-BRbpugj0.js:1
msgid "The following questions need grading: {questions}. Do you want to save anyway?"
msgstr "Las siguientes preguntas necesitan calificación: {questions}. ¿Deseas guardar de todos modos?"

#: frontend/src/pages/CourseAssessment.vue:199
#: seminary/public/frontend/assets/CourseAssessment-4OpsOBdH.js:4
msgid "The framework names no evaluators who grade activities."
msgstr "El marco no designa evaluadores que califiquen actividades."

#. Description of the 'Standard Question Key' (Data) field in DocType 'Personal
#. Development Plan Goal'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/personal_development_plan_goal/personal_development_plan_goal.json
msgid "The framework prompt this goal answers, if any. Stored as the key rather than a Link because the questions are child rows of Competency Framework and a Link cannot target one."
msgstr ""
"La pregunta del marco a la que responde este objetivo, si la hay. Se "
"almacena como clave en lugar de como enlace porque las preguntas son filas "
"secundarias del marco de competencias y un enlace no puede dirigirse a una "
"de ellas."

#. Description of the 'Assessment' (Link) field in DocType 'Activity Competency
#. Grade'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/activity_competency_grade/activity_competency_grade.json
msgid "The graded activity this level is for."
msgstr "La actividad evaluada a la que corresponde este nivel."

#. Description of the 'Assessment' (Link) field in DocType 'Assessment
#. Dimension Weight'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/assessment_dimension_weight/assessment_dimension_weight.json
msgid "The graded activity this weight belongs to."
msgstr "La actividad evaluada a la que pertenece esta ponderación."

#: seminary/seminary/doctype/course_competency/course_competency.js:48
msgid "The grading scale for this course defines no dimensions."
msgstr "La escala de calificación de este curso no define ninguna dimensión."

#. Description of the 'Graduation Requirement Item' (Link) field in DocType
#. 'Internship Type'
#: seminary/partner/doctype/internship_type/internship_type.json
msgid "The graduation requirement library item this internship fulfils. A student may apply only when their active enrollment has an open requirement of this item; completion reflects back to it."
msgstr ""
"El elemento de la biblioteca de requisitos de graduación que cumple esta "
"pasantía. Un estudiante solo puede solicitarla cuando su matrícula activa "
"tiene un requisito abierto de este elemento; la finalización se refleja en "
"él."

#. Description of the 'Graduation Requirement' (Link) field in DocType
#. 'Leveling Profile Item'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/leveling_profile_item/leveling_profile_item.json
msgid "The graduation requirement to waive (advanced standing)."
msgstr "El requisito de graduación que se debe eximir (nivel avanzado)."

#: seminary/seminary/doctype/address_geocoding_settings/address_geocoding_settings.js:44
msgid "The hosting provider's geocoding endpoint."
msgstr "El punto de conexión de geocodificación del proveedor de alojamiento."

#. Description of the 'Person' (Link) field in DocType 'External Examiner'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/external_examiner/external_examiner.json
msgid "The human on record (shared contact spine). Create or pick a Person; their name and email are pulled from it."
msgstr ""
"La persona registrada (registro de contactos compartido). Cree o seleccione "
"una Persona; su nombre y correo electrónico se obtienen de ahí."

#. Description of the 'Person' (Link) field in DocType 'Alumni Profile'
#. Description of the 'Person' (Link) field in DocType 'Instructor'
#. Description of the 'Person' (Link) field in DocType 'Student'
#: seminary/alumni/doctype/alumni_profile/alumni_profile.json
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/instructor/instructor.json
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/student/student.json
msgid "The human this record is about, and only one such record per human. Created first: a role record says what someone does here, not who they are."
msgstr ""
"La persona a la que se refiere este registro, y solo un registro de este "
"tipo por persona. Se crea primero: un registro de rol indica qué hace "
"alguien aquí, no quién es."

#: frontend/src/components/Modals/ReportDisciplinaryIncidentModal.vue:255
#: seminary/public/frontend/assets/index-Ck-8tQPp.js:9
msgid "The incident has been successfully reported."
msgstr "El incidente se ha comunicado correctamente."

#: seminary/install.py:151
msgid "The instructor cannot teach the course (illness, leave, departure, scheduling conflict)."
msgstr ""
"El instructor no puede impartir el curso (enfermedad, permiso, salida, "
"conflicto de horarios)."

#. Description of the 'Description' (Text Editor) field in DocType 'Internship
#. Position'
#: seminary/partner/doctype/internship_position/internship_position.json
msgid "The internship's focus and responsibilities."
msgstr "El enfoque y las responsabilidades de la pasantía."

#. Description of the 'Instructor Category' (Link) field in DocType 'Competency
#. Framework Evaluator'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/competency_framework_evaluator/competency_framework_evaluator.json
msgid "The kind of mentor this row describes. Only categories marked as competency evaluators are offered."
msgstr ""
"El tipo de mentor que describe esta fila. Solo se ofrecen las categorías "
"marcadas como evaluadores de competencias."

#. Description of the 'Mentor Type' (Link) field in DocType 'Program Enrollment
#. Mentor'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/program_enrollment_mentor/program_enrollment_mentor.json
msgid "The kind of mentoring this person provides for this student."
msgstr "El tipo de mentoría que esta persona proporciona a este estudiante."

#. Description of the 'Position Type' (Select) field in DocType 'Partner Job
#. Opening'
#: seminary/partner/doctype/partner_job_opening/partner_job_opening.json
msgid "The kind of ministry role, used to match and filter openings."
msgstr ""
"El tipo de función ministerial, utilizado para relacionar y filtrar "
"oportunidades."

#. Description of the 'Invited By' (Link) field in DocType 'Cohort Membership'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/cohort_membership/cohort_membership.json
msgid "The leader (Person) who invited this member."
msgstr "La persona líder que invitó a este miembro."

#: frontend/src/components/CourseOutline.vue:136
#: seminary/public/frontend/assets/CourseOutline-D-AFA-Qk.js:1
msgid "The lessons in this chapter open once the previous self-assessment is in."
msgstr ""
"Las lecciones de este capítulo se abren cuando se haya completado la "
"autoevaluación anterior."

#: seminary/www/verify_address.py:55
msgid "The link may have been broken by your mail program. Try copying the whole address from the message, or send yourself a new confirmation from Preferences."
msgstr ""
"Es posible que su programa de correo haya dañado el enlace. Intente copiar "
"la dirección completa del mensaje o envíese una nueva confirmación desde "
"Preferencias."

#. Description of the 'Fulfilling Status' (Data) field in DocType 'Student
#. Graduation Requirement'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/student_graduation_requirement/student_graduation_requirement.json
msgid "The linked document status that fulfils this row (snapshotted when an umbrella option is chosen). reflect_linked_doc_status prefers this over the policy row's value."
msgstr ""
"El estado del documento vinculado que cumple esta fila (capturado cuando se "
"selecciona una opción general). reflect_linked_doc_status prefiere este "
"estado al valor de la fila de políticas."

#. Description of the 'Primary Contact' (Check) field in DocType 'Partner
#. Contact'
#: seminary/partner/doctype/partner_contact/partner_contact.json
msgid "The main point of contact for this organization."
msgstr "El principal contacto de esta organización."

#. Description of the 'Primary Email' (Data) field in DocType 'Person Import
#. Row'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/person_import_row/person_import_row.json
msgid "The match/identity key. One Person is resolved per email. Format is validated during Dry-Run, not at save, so bad values can be staged and reported."
msgstr ""
"La clave de coincidencia/identidad. Se resuelve una persona por correo "
"electrónico. El formato se valida durante Dry-Run, no al guardar, por lo que "
"los valores incorrectos pueden prepararse y notificarse."

#. Description of the 'Evaluator' (Link) field in DocType 'Activity Competency
#. Grade'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/activity_competency_grade/activity_competency_grade.json
msgid "The mentor giving this level. Students do not grade activities; their self-assessment is recorded on the competency instead."
msgstr ""
"El mentor que otorga este nivel. Los estudiantes no califican las "
"actividades; su autoevaluación se registra en la competencia."

#. Description of the 'In Reply To' (Link) field in DocType 'Communication Log'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/communication_log/communication_log.json
msgid "The message this one replies to — links a conversation thread."
msgstr "El mensaje al que este responde — vincula un hilo de conversación."

#. Description of the 'Milestone Row' (Data) field in DocType 'Culminating
#. Project Submission'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/culminating_project_submission/culminating_project_submission.json
msgid "The milestone (child row name) this submission was made against."
msgstr ""
"El hito (nombre de la fila secundaria) con respecto al cual se realizó este "
"envío."

#: seminary/seminary/doctype/cohort_type/cohort_type.py:349
msgid "The minimum cohort size ({0}) is larger than the maximum ({1}), so no proposed cohort could ever be the right size."
msgstr ""
"El tamaño mínimo de la cohorte ({0}) es mayor que el máximo ({1}), por lo "
"que ninguna cohorte propuesta podría tener el tamaño adecuado."

#: seminary/seminary/discipleship/api.py:944
msgid "The new leader must be an active member."
msgstr "El nuevo líder debe ser un miembro activo."

#. Description of the 'Direct Recipient' (Link) field in DocType 'Cohort Post'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/cohort_post/cohort_post.json
msgid "The one person a direct post is addressed to."
msgstr "La única persona a la que va dirigida una publicación directa."

#: seminary/seminary/page/cohort_planner/cohort_planner.js:518
msgid "The only cohort here matching this student."
msgstr "La única cohorte aquí que coincide con este estudiante."

#: frontend/src/pages/JobApplication.vue:65
#: seminary/public/frontend/assets/JobApplication-C3DAKwwI.js:1
msgid "The organization"
msgstr "La organización"

#: frontend/src/pages/JobApplication.vue:107
#: seminary/public/frontend/assets/JobApplication-C3DAKwwI.js:1
msgid "The organization's doctrinal statement"
msgstr "La declaración doctrinal de la organización"

#. Description of the 'Follow Up Of' (Link) field in DocType 'Communication
#. Log'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/communication_log/communication_log.json
msgid "The outbound log this row is a follow-up to."
msgstr "El registro de salida al que da seguimiento esta fila."

#. Description of a DocType
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/plagiarism_check_result/plagiarism_check_result.json
msgid "The outcome of a plagiarism check on a submission: an overall similarity score plus the other submissions it most resembled. Created by the grader's 'Run check' action and never visible to students."
msgstr ""
"El resultado de una comprobación de plagio en una entrega: un índice de "
"similitud general, además de las otras entregas a las que más se parecía. Lo "
"crea la acción «Ejecutar comprobación» del evaluador y nunca es visible para "
"los estudiantes."

#. Description of the 'Partner Signs Complete' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Internship Requirement Template'
#: seminary/partner/doctype/internship_requirement_template/internship_requirement_template.json
msgid "The partner organization (site supervisor) signs this requirement complete."
msgstr ""
"La organización asociada (supervisor del sitio) marca este requisito como "
"completado."

#. Description of the 'Anchor Reference' (Data) field in DocType 'Cohort Post
#. Comment'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/cohort_post_comment/cohort_post_comment.json
msgid "The passage this comment is anchored to, as typed."
msgstr "El pasaje al que está anclado este comentario, tal como se escribió."

#. Description of the 'Reviewer' (Link) field in DocType 'Partner Job
#. Application Review'
#: seminary/partner/doctype/partner_job_application_review/partner_job_application_review.json
msgid "The person who reviewed this application (links Person, the identity spine — Partner Contact is a child table and cannot be linked)."
msgstr ""
"La persona que revisó esta solicitud (vincula a Persona, el eje de "
"identidad; Contacto del socio es una tabla secundaria y no se puede vincular)"
"."

#. Description of the 'Reads' (Data) field in DocType 'Cohort Assignment
#. Criterion'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/cohort_assignment_criterion/cohort_assignment_criterion.json
msgid "The personal detail this rule reads. A person missing it cannot be matched by this rule, which is what the planner's readiness check reports before a run."
msgstr ""
"El dato personal que lee esta regla. Una persona que no lo tenga no puede "
"coincidir con esta regla; eso es lo que informa la comprobación de "
"preparación del planificador antes de una ejecución."

#. Description of the 'Target Program' (Link) field in DocType 'Partner
#. Transcript Import Batch'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/partner_transcript_import_batch/partner_transcript_import_batch.json
msgid "The program at this institution the credits apply toward. Each row's resolved internal course should be a course in this program's catalog."
msgstr "El programa en esta institución se aplica a los créditos y el curso interno de cada fila debe ser un curso en el catálogo de este programa."

#. Description of the 'Program' (Link) field in DocType 'Cohort Type'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/cohort_type/cohort_type.json
msgid "The program cohorts of this type belong to. Required by Paced Program, which moves its members together and so cannot be defined at level scope. Also asked for when leaders must be alumni of the bound program — fill this or Program Level, or choose Any alumnus instead."
msgstr ""
"Las cohortes del programa al que pertenece este tipo. Es obligatorio para el "
"programa con ritmo establecido, que hace avanzar a sus miembros juntos y, "
"por lo tanto, no puede definirse en el ámbito del nivel. También se solicita "
"cuando los líderes deben ser exalumnos del programa asociado: complete este "
"campo o Nivel del programa, o elija Cualquier exalumno."

#: seminary/seminary/doctype/address_geocoding_settings/address_geocoding_settings.py:50
msgid "The provider answered but matched nothing for a landmark address, which usually means the endpoint is not a geocoding service."
msgstr ""
"El proveedor respondió, pero no encontró coincidencias para una dirección de "
"un punto de referencia, lo que normalmente significa que el endpoint no es "
"un servicio de geocodificación."

#: seminary/seminary/integrations/geocoding.py:428
msgid "The provider could not be reached. It will be retried."
msgstr "No se pudo contactar con el proveedor. Se volverá a intentar."

#: seminary/public/js/geo_location.bundle.js:60
msgid "The provider could not be reached. The daily sweeper will try again."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo contactar con el proveedor. El proceso de revisión diaria volverá "
"a intentarlo."

#: seminary/seminary/integrations/geocoding.py:426
msgid "The provider knows of no such address."
msgstr "El proveedor no conoce ninguna dirección de ese tipo."

#: seminary/public/js/geo_location.bundle.js:54
msgid "The provider knows of no such address. Correct the address above; it is not retried on its own."
msgstr ""
"El proveedor no reconoce esa dirección. Corrija la dirección anterior; no se "
"volverá a intentar automáticamente."

#. Description of the 'Term Admission' (Link) field in DocType 'Student
#. Applicant'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/student_applicant/student_applicant.json
msgid "The published Term Admission window the applicant is responding to. Optional for Continuous-enrollment programs."
msgstr "La ventana de admisión a plazo publicada al solicitante está respondiendo. Opcional para programas de matriculación continua."

#. Description of the 'Reference' (Data) field in DocType 'Cohort Post
#. Scripture Ref'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/cohort_post_scripture_ref/cohort_post_scripture_ref.json
msgid "The reference as typed, e.g. \"Jn 3:16-18\"."
msgstr "La referencia tal como se escribió, p. ej., \"Jn 3:16-18\"."

#. Description of the 'Reference' (Data) field in DocType 'Question'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/question/question.json
msgid "The reference students will memorize, e.g. 'Jn 3:16' or 'Sl 23:1'."
msgstr ""
"La referencia que los estudiantes memorizarán, por ejemplo, «Jn 3:16» o «Sal "
"23:1»."

#. Description of the 'Parent Comment' (Link) field in DocType 'Cohort Post
#. Comment'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/cohort_post_comment/cohort_post_comment.json
msgid "The reply this one is nested under. Empty for a top-level reply."
msgstr ""
"La respuesta bajo la cual está anidada esta. Vacío para una respuesta de "
"nivel superior."

#. Description of the 'Final' (Float) field in DocType 'Competency Result'
#. Description of the 'Final' (Float) field in DocType 'Competency Result
#. Dimension'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/competency_result/competency_result.json
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/competency_result_dimension/competency_result_dimension.json
msgid "The reported result, after any override and after rounding."
msgstr "El resultado informado, después de cualquier anulación y del redondeo."

#. Description of the 'Created Requirement' (Data) field in DocType 'Student
#. Graduation Requirement'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/student_graduation_requirement/student_graduation_requirement.json
msgid "The requirement row created for the chosen option. Changing the choice replaces it."
msgstr ""
"La fila de requisitos creada para la opción elegida. Al cambiar la "
"selección, se reemplaza."

#. Description of the 'Attachment' (Attach) field in DocType 'Culminating
#. Project Milestone Signoff'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/culminating_project_milestone_signoff/culminating_project_milestone_signoff.json
msgid "The reviewer's marked-up document or evaluation form for this sign-off."
msgstr ""
"El documento con anotaciones del revisor o el formulario de evaluación de "
"esta aprobación."

#. Description of the 'Handler' (Data) field in DocType 'Cohort Assignment
#. Criterion'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/cohort_assignment_criterion/cohort_assignment_criterion.json
msgid "The rule this record runs. It is part of the program, not a setting, so the name above can be changed freely without changing what the rule does."
msgstr ""
"La regla que ejecuta este registro. Forma parte del programa, no es una "
"configuración, por lo que el nombre anterior se puede cambiar libremente sin "
"modificar lo que hace la regla."

#. Description of the 'courses' (Table) field in DocType 'Program'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/program/program.json
msgid "The same course may be used in different programs, in different terms and with different number of credits."
msgstr "El mismo curso se puede utilizar en diferentes programas, en diferentes términos y con un número diferente de créditos."

#. Description of the 'Default Grading Scale' (Link) field in DocType 'Partner
#. Seminary'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/partner_seminary/partner_seminary.json
msgid "The scale on which this partner records grades. Must be a Submitted Grading Scale."
msgstr "La escala en la que este socio registra las calificaciones. Debe ser una escala de Calificación enviada."

#. Description of the 'Grading Scale' (Link) field in DocType 'Competency
#. Framework'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/competency_framework/competency_framework.json
msgid "The scale that defines the proficiency levels and the dimensions (for example knowledge, character, craft) used everywhere in this framework."
msgstr ""
"La escala que define los niveles de competencia y las dimensiones (por "
"ejemplo, conocimiento, carácter y práctica) que se utilizan en todo este "
