#. Description of a DocType
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/competency_result/competency_result.json
msgid "Where a student ended up on one competency, dimension by dimension. Holds the calculated value, any edit an evaluator made to it, and the rounded result that appears on the transcript and the radar."
msgstr ""
"Resultado de un estudiante en una competencia, dimensión por dimensión. "
"Contiene el valor calculado, cualquier modificación que le haya hecho un "
"evaluador y el resultado redondeado que aparece en el expediente académico y "
"en el radar."

#. Description of the 'Preferred Email for Applications' (Data) field in
#. DocType 'Person'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/person/person.json
msgid "Where partners should reach you about job applications. Leave blank to use your primary email."
msgstr ""
"Dónde deben ponerse en contacto contigo los socios acerca de las solicitudes "
"de empleo. Déjalo en blanco para utilizar tu correo electrónico principal."

#. Description of the 'Hero Button Link' (Data) field in DocType 'Website
#. Branding'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/website_branding/website_branding.json
msgid "Where the hero button links (e.g. /program, or a direct application URL). Leave blank to hide the button."
msgstr ""
"Dónde enlaza el botón principal (p. ej., /programa o una URL directa de "
"solicitud). Déjalo en blanco para ocultar el botón."

#: frontend/src/pages/CommunicationPreferences.vue:75
#: seminary/public/frontend/assets/CommunicationPreferences-D6a5L0SB.js:1
msgid "Where the seminary sends printed letters."
msgstr "Donde el seminario envía las cartas impresas."

#. Description of the 'Baseline' (Float) field in DocType 'Competency Result
#. Dimension'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/competency_result_dimension/competency_result_dimension.json
msgid "Where the student placed themselves at the start."
msgstr "Dónde se ubicó el estudiante al inicio."

#. Description of the 'Source' (Data) field in DocType 'Person Consent'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/person_consent/person_consent.json
msgid "Where this consent was captured: portal preferences, paper form, import..."
msgstr ""
"Dónde se registró este consentimiento: preferencias del portal, formulario "
"en papel, importación..."

#. Description of the 'Field' (Data) field in DocType 'Mandatory Personal
#. Field'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/mandatory_personal_field/mandatory_personal_field.json
msgid "Where this detail is stored on a person's record. Part of the application, not a setting."
msgstr ""
"Dónde se almacena este dato en el registro de una persona. Forma parte de la "
"aplicación, no es una configuración."

#. Description of the 'Assignment Source' (Select) field in DocType 'Competency
#. Framework Evaluator'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/competency_framework_evaluator/competency_framework_evaluator.json
msgid "Where this evaluator is found. Course Schedule Instructors evaluate everyone in the section; Program Cohort finds the mentors of the student's cohort of the named type."
msgstr ""
"Dónde se encuentra este evaluador. Los instructores del horario del curso "
"evalúan a todos en la sección; Cohorte del programa encuentra a los mentores "
"de la cohorte del estudiante del tipo indicado."

#: frontend/src/pages/PersonalDevelopmentPlan.vue:158
#: seminary/public/frontend/assets/PersonalDevelopmentPlan-BahtR62c.js:2
msgid "Where this stands"
msgstr "Situación actual"

#: frontend/src/pages/CompetencyProfile.vue:24
#: seminary/public/frontend/assets/CompetencyProfile-BcUEvrkl.js:1
msgid "Where you said you were starting, where you say you are now, and what your mentors saw. The gaps between them are the conversation."
msgstr ""
"Dónde dijiste que comenzabas, dónde dices que estás ahora y qué observaron "
"tus mentores. Las diferencias entre estos puntos son la conversación."

#. Description of the 'Used by Matching Rules' (Check) field in DocType
#. 'Mandatory Personal Field'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/mandatory_personal_field/mandatory_personal_field.json
msgid "Whether a cohort matching rule can read this detail. Only a few can."
msgstr ""
"Indica si una regla de coincidencia de cohortes puede leer este dato. Solo "
"unas pocas pueden hacerlo."

#. Description of the 'Second Reader Type' (Select) field in DocType
#. 'Culminating Project Type'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/culminating_project_type/culminating_project_type.json
msgid "Whether the Second Reader is an internal Instructor or an External Examiner."
msgstr "Si el segundo lector es un instructor interno o un examinador externo."

#. Description of the 'Third Reader Type' (Select) field in DocType
#. 'Culminating Project Type'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/culminating_project_type/culminating_project_type.json
msgid "Whether the Third Reader is an internal Instructor or an External Examiner."
msgstr ""
"Indica si el tercer lector es un Instructor interno o un Examinador externo."

#. Description of the 'Invite Again' (Check) field in DocType 'External
#. Examiner'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/external_examiner/external_examiner.json
msgid "Whether the seminary would invite this examiner again (institutional memory)."
msgstr ""
"Si el seminario volvería a invitar a este examinador (memoria institucional)."

#. Description of the 'Can Supervise Interns' (Check) field in DocType 'Partner
#. Contact'
#: seminary/partner/doctype/partner_contact/partner_contact.json
msgid "Whether this person may be assigned as a site supervisor for internship placements. Uncheck to block a specific contact."
msgstr ""
"Indica si esta persona puede ser asignada como supervisora en el sitio para "
"prácticas profesionales. Desmarque esta opción para bloquear a un contacto "
"específico."

#. Description of the 'Count in GPA' (Check) field in DocType 'Program
#. Enrollment Course'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/program_enrollment_course/program_enrollment_course.json
msgid "Whether this row contributes to GPA calculation. Set to 0 for withdrawals using a notation (WP/WF) whose Grading Scale flag (wp_gpa / wf_gpa) excludes it."
msgstr "Si este registro contribuye al cálculo de GPA. Establecer en 0 para retiros usando una notación (WP/WF) cuya bandera de Escala de Calificación (wp_gpa / wf_gpa) lo excluye."

#. Description of the 'Advisor Pool Unit' (Link) field in DocType 'Internship
#. Type'
#: seminary/partner/doctype/internship_type/internship_type.json
msgid "Which Academic Unit's Internship Advisor pool to draw from. Leave blank to use the backing course's Academic Unit. One of the two is required when Auto-Assign is on."
msgstr ""
"De qué unidad académica se debe seleccionar el grupo de asesores de "
"prácticas. Déjelo en blanco para usar la unidad académica del curso "
"asociado. Se requiere una de las dos cuando la asignación automática está "
"activada."

#: frontend/src/components/CLOCoveragePanel.vue:7
#: seminary/public/frontend/assets/CourseAssessment-4OpsOBdH.js:2
msgid "Which learning outcomes this offering actually measures — and which nothing measures."
msgstr ""
"Qué resultados de aprendizaje mide realmente esta oferta y cuáles no mide "
"nada."

#. Description of a DocType
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/mandatory_personal_field/mandatory_personal_field.json
msgid "Which personal details your school insists on recording. The list itself ships with the application — you decide which of them are required. A detail that a cohort matching rule reads must be required before that rule can be used, because a rule cannot match on something nobody has filled in."
msgstr ""
"Qué datos personales insiste su institución educativa en registrar. La lista "
"viene incluida con la aplicación; usted decide cuáles son obligatorios. Un "
"dato que lee una regla de coincidencia de cohortes debe ser obligatorio "
"antes de poder usar esa regla, porque una regla no puede coincidir basándose "
"en algo que nadie ha rellenado."

#. Description of the 'Enabled' (Check) field in DocType 'Address Geocoding
#. Settings'
#: seminary/seminary/doctype/address_geocoding_settings/address_geocoding_settings.json
msgid "While off, addresses are stored as usual and simply not geocoded."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está desactivado, las direcciones se almacenan como de costumbre y "
"simplemente no se geocodifican."

